{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/476883-another-durations-of-influence-question","id":476883,"title":"Another durations of Influence question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-11T06:54:38-07:00","id":476883,"title":"Another durations of Influence question","content":"So say you have 3 dots of an Influence. You spend your two Essence and use it to fire up a Manipulate action for tens of minutes. Does that mean the one instance of the thing you're manipulating is going to keep doing the (semi-natural) thing you told it to do for tens of minutes, or that for tens of minutes you are generally able to Manipulate various instances of that thing?<br /> <br /> (I wish I could find a pattern to when I use numerals and when I use text to call out numbers. It's starting to bug me...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4563-terraben","name":"TerraBen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T08:08:18-07:00","id":476957,"title":"","content":"I believe it's the former - the changes you make last for the duration. Additional changes require additional influence rolls and have their own duration.<br /> <br /> Also, <a href=\"http://m.grammarbook.com/other-rules/writing-numbers.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> is a fairly detailed style guide on use of numerals versus writing out numbers. Ultimately there are no official rules on the matter, so it's up to the individual author to do what suits them, as long as you're consistent you're fine. But the rules in the above link are the most generally agreed-upon conventions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T08:51:18-07:00","id":477012,"title":"","content":"Thanks for following up on my parenthetical. I haven't followed your link just yet. Growing up, the general style point I was given was that numbers below 100 should be written out in text, but numerals were acceptable from there up.<br /> My issue is mostly that I don't think I am being consistent, but I'm not sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4563-terraben","name":"TerraBen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T09:05:49-07:00","id":477021,"title":"","content":"That's a common rule, although there's a lot of variations in the cut-off point. Some say to use numerals for numbers 100 and over, others say to use them for numbers with more than one digit, some say to spell out single-word numbers (so twenty would be written out but 22 would be numerals). It's pretty generally agreed upon that if you start a sentence with a number, you should always write it out. Dates and times use numerals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}